        "Id": "582521b6-ced5-41a0-82ca-4415a137b352",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "a hotdog to die for",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111429472393",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 536ca481-8fd1-4c1e-95ef-4d9dd31ba8c7).Image",
        "Description": "47, \r\rAs you have worked with me for some time now you know I only have two weaknesses- men in tanktops and hot dogs. My Ex boyfriend is attending the miami grand prix with his new 18 year old girlfriend. He has been waiting his whole life for this race. DO make sure he doesn&apos;t get to see it. He took me to a race here for our first date- he bought me a hotdog that gave me food poisoning. Ruin everyone&apos;s day at the race 47. I want Frank to never enjoy another race. \r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
